OL,3,GNEWSANo 'switch' to stop small boats,
OL,4,ALucy Powell tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no "switch" to stop small boat
OL,7,Fcrossings, and not every migrant boat
OL,8,Fcan be intercepted, Labour's deputy
OL,9,Fleader has told the BBC.
OL,11,FLucy Powell's comments came after two
OL,12,Funcontrolled landings from the Channel
OL,13,Fin two days, at Folkestone and Samphire
OL,14,FHoe in Kent.
OL,16,FThe Home Secretary, Shabana Mahmood,
OL,17,Fhas ordered an urgent review by Border
OL,18,FSecurity Command, calling the failure
OL,19,Fto intercept the two boats "not
OL,20,Facceptable".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
